00:57:31.870 --> 00:57:34.270
But again, if you want to
use other languages, using

00:57:34.270 --> 00:57:36.310
a RESTful API, or
RESTful library

00:57:36.310 --> 00:57:39.730
will work perfectly for you.

00:57:39.730 --> 00:57:42.415
So just an example
using the SB server

